{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization-mathematical-programming","title":"优化与数学规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/scientific-core/optimization-mathematical-programming","wordCount":1614,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"优化与数学规划\">优化与数学规划</h1><p>JuMP.jl 是 Julia 生态中数学优化建模的事实标准——一种嵌入式领域特定语言（DSL），让用户用接近数学论文的语法描述优化问题，由框架自动将其转化为求解器的标准形式。2026 年 5 月 JuMP-dev 2026 在爱丁堡召开，JuMP 已被 MIT GenX、NREL Sienna 等洲际规模能源系统模型用于生产环境，其底层的 MathOptInterface（MOI）抽象层使得在 40+ 求解器之间无缝切换成为可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Julia 优化生态的骨架是一条分层链：最上层是建模语言，中间是抽象接口，最下层是可替换的求解器。JuMP 用宏把接近论文的数学语法在编译期解析成求解器数据结构；MathOptInterface（MOI）把一切问题统一为「function-in-set」的标准形式，并靠 Bridge 层在用户约束形式不被目标求解器原生支持时自动插入数学等价变换——这两层共同实现了<strong>模型与求解器分离</strong>，使同一模型可在 40+ 求解器之间无缝切换，也解释了为什么同一个问题既能交给开源 HiGHS 又能交给商业 Gurobi。在此之上，选择哪个包取决于问题的数学性质：JuMP 是通用建模层、不验证凸性；Convex.jl 用 DCP 规则在编译期证明凸性、换取全局最优保证；Optimization.jl 则面向数值优化，其价值在于 AD 后端（ForwardDiff/Zygote/Enzyme）可按问题规模切换。下文沿 JuMP 建模范式、MOI 抽象层、非线性优化、凸优化、统一数值优化与整数规划逐层展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jump-建模范式\">JuMP 建模范式</h2><p>JuMP 的核心设计理念是<strong>模型与求解器分离</strong>：用声明式语法描述数学规划问题，再通过 MOI 桥接层将其转化为目标求解器（Gurobi、CPLEX、Mosek、HiGHS、Ipopt 等）可接受的标准形式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using JuMP, HiGHS&#10;&#10;model = Model(HiGHS.Optimizer)&#10;set_silent(model)&#10;&#10;@variable(model, x &gt;= 0)&#10;@variable(model, y &gt;= 0)&#10;&#10;@objective(model, Max, 5x + 3y)&#10;&#10;@constraint(model, con1, x + 2y &lt;= 14)&#10;@constraint(model, con2, 3x + y &lt;= 14)&#10;@constraint(model, con3, x + y &lt;= 8)&#10;&#10;optimize!(model)&#10;&#10;println(&quot;最优值: &quot;, objective_value(model))&#10;println(&quot;x = &quot;, value(x), &quot;, y = &quot;, value(y))&#10;println(&quot;con1 对偶值: &quot;, dual(con1))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using JuMP, HiGHS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model = Model(HiGHS.Optimizer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_silent(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@variable(model, x >= 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@variable(model, y >= 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@objective(model, Max, 5x + 3y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, con1, x + 2y &#x3C;= 14)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, con2, 3x + y &#x3C;= 14)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, con3, x + y &#x3C;= 8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>optimize!(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"最优值: \", objective_value(model))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"x = \", value(x), \", y = \", value(y))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"con1 对偶值: \", dual(con1))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>JuMP 宏（<code>@variable</code>、<code>@constraint</code>、<code>@objective</code>）是<a href=\"../foundations/metaprogramming-macros\">元编程与宏系统</a>的直接应用——它们在编译期将数学表达式解析为求解器数据结构，运行时零 overhead。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题类别</th>\n<th>JuMP 支持</th>\n<th>典型求解器</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性规划 LP</td>\n<td><code>@constraint</code> 线性约束</td>\n<td>HiGHS, Gurobi, CPLEX</td>\n<td>运输、调度、混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合整数规划 MIP</td>\n<td><code>Bin</code>/<code>Int</code> 变量</td>\n<td>Gurobi, CPLEX, SCIP</td>\n<td>网络设计、排班</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次规划 QP</td>\n<td>二次目标/约束</td>\n<td>Gurobi, Mosek, OSQP</td>\n<td>组合优化、MPC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锥规划 SOCP/SDP</td>\n<td><code>SecondOrderCone</code>, <code>PSDCone</code></td>\n<td>Mosek, SCS, CSDP</td>\n<td>信号处理、控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非线性规划 NLP</td>\n<td><code>@NLconstraint</code>（旧）/ 非线性表达式</td>\n<td>Ipopt, KNITRO, Juniper</td>\n<td>化工、最优控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mathoptinterface-抽象层\">MathOptInterface 抽象层</h2><p>MOI 定义了求解器与建模层之间的通用接口——函数（objectives）、集合（constraints = function-in-set）、属性（solver parameters）三要素：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[JuMP 模型&lt;br/&gt;高级数学语法] --&gt; B[MathOptInterface&lt;br/&gt;标准形式: function-in-set]&#10;    B --&gt; C{求解器桥接}&#10;    C --&gt;|线性/整数| D[HiGHS / Gurobi / CPLEX]&#10;    C --&gt;|锥优化| E[Mosek / SCS / CSDP]&#10;    C --&gt;|非线性| F[Ipopt / KNITRO]&#10;    C --&gt;|混合整数非线性| G[Juniper / Bonmin]&#10;    B --&gt; H[自动桥接层&lt;br/&gt;Bridges]&#10;    H --&gt;|SOS1 → MIP 编码| D&#10;    H --&gt;|旋转锥 → 标准锥| E&#10;    H --&gt;|指示约束 → Big-M| D\">graph TD\n    A[JuMP 模型&lt;br/&gt;高级数学语法] --&gt; B[MathOptInterface&lt;br/&gt;标准形式: function-in-set]\n    B --&gt; C{求解器桥接}\n    C --&gt;|线性/整数| D[HiGHS / Gurobi / CPLEX]\n    C --&gt;|锥优化| E[Mosek / SCS / CSDP]\n    C --&gt;|非线性| F[Ipopt / KNITRO]\n    C --&gt;|混合整数非线性| G[Juniper / Bonmin]\n    B --&gt; H[自动桥接层&lt;br/&gt;Bridges]\n    H --&gt;|SOS1 → MIP 编码| D\n    H --&gt;|旋转锥 → 标准锥| E\n    H --&gt;|指示约束 → Big-M| D</pre><p>桥接（Bridges）是 MOI 的精髓之一：当用户使用的约束形式不被目标求解器原生支持时，MOI 自动插入数学等价的变换。例如，将旋转二阶锥约束转化为标准二阶锥，或将 SOS1 约束编码为二进制变量——这一切对用户透明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"非线性优化与自动微分\">非线性优化与自动微分</h2><p>JuMP 在 2024-2025 年间完成了<strong>非线性建模的重大重构</strong>——从基于 <code>@NL*</code> 宏的专用 AST 迁移到统一的表达式系统。新接口直接使用标准 <code>@constraint</code> 和 <code>@objective</code>，支持用户自定义非线性算子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using JuMP, Ipopt&#10;&#10;model = Model(Ipopt.Optimizer)&#10;set_silent(model)&#10;&#10;@variable(model, x[1:3], start = 0.1)&#10;&#10;# 新非线性接口：直接用 Julia 表达式&#10;@constraint(model, x[1]^2 + x[2]^2 + x[3]^2 &lt;= 1.0)&#10;@objective(model, Min, (x[1] - 1)^2 + (x[2] - 2)^2 + x[3]^2)&#10;&#10;# 用户自定义非线性函数&#10;f(x, y) = log(x) * exp(y)&#10;@operator(model, op_f, 2, f)&#10;@constraint(model, op_f(x[1], x[2]) &gt;= 0.5)&#10;&#10;optimize!(model)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using JuMP, Ipopt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model = Model(Ipopt.Optimizer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_silent(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@variable(model, x[1:3], start = 0.1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 新非线性接口：直接用 Julia 表达式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, x[1]^2 + x[2]^2 + x[3]^2 &#x3C;= 1.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@objective(model, Min, (x[1] - 1)^2 + (x[2] - 2)^2 + x[3]^2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 用户自定义非线性函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>f(x, y) = log(x) * exp(y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@operator(model, op_f, 2, f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, op_f(x[1], x[2]) >= 0.5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>optimize!(model)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>JuMP 的非线性后端通过 <strong>稀疏反向模式 AD</strong> 自动计算梯度和 Hessian，利用表达式图的结构信息进行稀疏性检测。对于大规模 NLP（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>+ 变量），稀疏 Hessian 的自动计算是保证求解效率的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"convex-jl-规范凸优化\">Convex.jl：规范凸优化</h2><p>对于<strong>凸</strong>优化问题，Convex.jl 提供基于 DCP（Disciplined Convex Programming）的验证式建模——编译期验证问题的凸性，保证全局最优：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Convex, SCS&#10;&#10;n = 5&#10;x = Variable(n)&#10;A = randn(10, n)&#10;b = randn(10)&#10;&#10;# DCP 规则自动验证凸性&#10;problem = minimize(&#10;    sumsquares(A * x - b),&#10;    [norm(x, Inf) &lt;= 1.0]&#10;)&#10;&#10;solve!(problem, SCS.Optimizer)&#10;println(&quot;最优 x = &quot;, evaluate(x))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Convex, SCS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>n = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = Variable(n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A = randn(10, n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>b = randn(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># DCP 规则自动验证凸性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>problem = minimize(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sumsquares(A * x - b),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [norm(x, Inf) &#x3C;= 1.0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>solve!(problem, SCS.Optimizer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"最优 x = \", evaluate(x))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Convex.jl 与 JuMP 互补：JuMP 是通用建模层（不验证凸性），Convex.jl 专注凸问题且提供数学正确性保证。两者共享 MOI 后端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"optimization-jl-统一无约束-约束优化\">Optimization.jl：统一无约束/约束优化</h2><p>SciML 生态的 Optimization.jl 为<strong>数值优化</strong>提供统一接口——覆盖梯度下降、拟牛顿、进化算法、贝叶斯优化等方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Optimization, OptimizationOptimJL&#10;&#10;# Rosenbrock 函数&#10;rosenbrock(u, p) = (p[1] - u[1])^2 + p[2] * (u[2] - u[1]^2)^2&#10;&#10;optf = OptimizationFunction(rosenbrock, AutoForwardDiff())&#10;prob = OptimizationProblem(optf, [0.0, 0.0], [1.0, 100.0])&#10;&#10;# L-BFGS 拟牛顿法&#10;sol = solve(prob, LBFGS())&#10;println(&quot;最优解: &quot;, sol.u)  # ≈ [1.0, 1.0]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Optimization, OptimizationOptimJL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Rosenbrock 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rosenbrock(u, p) = (p[1] - u[1])^2 + p[2] * (u[2] - u[1]^2)^2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>optf = OptimizationFunction(rosenbrock, AutoForwardDiff())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>prob = OptimizationProblem(optf, [0.0, 0.0], [1.0, 100.0])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># L-BFGS 拟牛顿法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sol = solve(prob, LBFGS())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"最优解: \", sol.u)  # ≈ [1.0, 1.0]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Optimization.jl 的核心价值在于<strong>AD 后端可切换</strong>——<code>AutoForwardDiff()</code>、<code>AutoZygote()</code>、<code>AutoEnzyme()</code> 可以根据问题规模和结构选择最优的自动微分策略，且与<a href=\"differential-equations\">微分方程求解</a>的敏感度分析共享同一 AD 基础设施。</p>\n<h2 id=\"整数规划与组合优化\">整数规划与组合优化</h2><p>混合整数规划（MIP）是 JuMP 的强项之一。商业求解器（Gurobi、CPLEX）通过 JuMP 的 <code>Bin</code> 和 <code>Int</code> 变量声明直接可用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using JuMP, HiGHS&#10;&#10;# 旅行商问题的 MTZ 子回路消除公式&#10;n = 10&#10;model = Model(HiGHS.Optimizer)&#10;&#10;@variable(model, x[1:n, 1:n], Bin)&#10;@variable(model, 2 &lt;= u[2:n] &lt;= n)&#10;&#10;# 每个城市恰好离开一次、到达一次&#10;@constraint(model, [i=1:n], sum(x[i, :]) == 1)&#10;@constraint(model, [j=1:n], sum(x[:, j]) == 1)&#10;@constraint(model, [i=1:n], x[i, i] == 0)&#10;&#10;# MTZ 子回路消除&#10;@constraint(model, [i=2:n, j=2:n; i != j],&#10;    u[i] - u[j] + n * x[i, j] &lt;= n - 1)&#10;&#10;# 目标：最小化总距离&#10;dist = rand(n, n)&#10;@objective(model, Min, sum(dist .* x))&#10;&#10;optimize!(model)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using JuMP, HiGHS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 旅行商问题的 MTZ 子回路消除公式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>n = 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model = Model(HiGHS.Optimizer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@variable(model, x[1:n, 1:n], Bin)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@variable(model, 2 &#x3C;= u[2:n] &#x3C;= n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 每个城市恰好离开一次、到达一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, [i=1:n], sum(x[i, :]) == 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, [j=1:n], sum(x[:, j]) == 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, [i=1:n], x[i, i] == 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># MTZ 子回路消除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, [i=2:n, j=2:n; i != j],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    u[i] - u[j] + n * x[i, j] &#x3C;= n - 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 目标：最小化总距离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dist = rand(n, n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@objective(model, Min, sum(dist .* x))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>optimize!(model)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于超大规模 MIP 问题，JuMP 支持<strong>回调</strong>（callbacks）接口——用户可以在分支定界过程中注入自定义切割平面、启发式解和惰性约束，与求解器的搜索过程深度集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战-投资组合优化\">实战：投资组合优化</h2><p>将理论连接到实际应用——Markowitz 均值-方差投资组合优化是二次规划的经典案例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using JuMP, OSQP, LinearAlgebra, Statistics&#10;&#10;# 模拟 5 只资产的历史收益率&#10;returns = randn(252, 5) .* 0.02&#10;μ = vec(mean(returns; dims=1))      # 预期收益&#10;Σ = cov(returns)                     # 协方差矩阵&#10;&#10;model = Model(OSQP.Optimizer)&#10;set_silent(model)&#10;&#10;@variable(model, w[1:5] &gt;= 0)       # 权重非负（只做多）&#10;@constraint(model, sum(w) == 1)      # 权重归一&#10;@constraint(model, μ&#39; * w &gt;= 0.001)  # 最低收益约束&#10;&#10;# 最小化组合方差&#10;@objective(model, Min, w&#39; * Σ * w)&#10;&#10;optimize!(model)&#10;println(&quot;最优权重: &quot;, round.(value.(w); digits=4))&#10;println(&quot;组合波动率: &quot;, sqrt(objective_value(model)))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using JuMP, OSQP, LinearAlgebra, Statistics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 模拟 5 只资产的历史收益率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>returns = randn(252, 5) .* 0.02</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>μ = vec(mean(returns; dims=1))      # 预期收益</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Σ = cov(returns)                     # 协方差矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model = Model(OSQP.Optimizer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>set_silent(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@variable(model, w[1:5] >= 0)       # 权重非负（只做多）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, sum(w) == 1)      # 权重归一</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@constraint(model, μ' * w >= 0.001)  # 最低收益约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 最小化组合方差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@objective(model, Min, w' * Σ * w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>optimize!(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"最优权重: \", round.(value.(w); digits=4))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(\"组合波动率: \", sqrt(objective_value(model)))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个例子展示了 JuMP 的核心优势：数学公式直接对应代码——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>w</mi></msub><msup><mi>w</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{w} w^T \\Sigma w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9913em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 写成 <code>@objective(model, Min, w&#39; * Σ * w)</code>，约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 写成 <code>sum(w) == 1</code>。对于更复杂的约束（交易成本、整数手数限制），只需添加约束行而无需重构模型架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分层架构是核心设计</strong>：JuMP（建模语言）→ MOI（function-in-set 标准形式）→ 求解器，模型与求解器分离使 40+ 求解器可无缝切换。</li>\n<li><strong>Bridge 层是 MOI 的精髓</strong>：用户约束形式不被原生支持时自动插入等价变换（旋转锥→标准锥、SOS1→二进制变量、指示约束→Big-M），对用户透明。</li>\n<li><strong>宏把数学语法零开销地编译为求解器数据结构</strong>：这是元编程在优化领域的直接落地，对应上文的 JuMP 建模。</li>\n<li><strong>非线性接口已完成重构</strong>：从 <code>@NL*</code> 专用 AST 迁移到统一表达式系统，梯度与 Hessian 由稀疏反向模式 AD 自动计算，大规模 NLP 的效率取决于稀疏性检测。</li>\n<li><strong>按问题的数学性质选包</strong>：JuMP 通用但不验证凸性，Convex.jl 用 DCP 规则保证凸问题的全局最优，Optimization.jl 面向数值优化且 AD 后端可切换。</li>\n<li><strong>MIP 与回调支持生产级应用</strong>：<code>Bin</code>/<code>Int</code> 声明直连商业求解器，回调接口允许在分支定界中注入切割平面、启发式解与惰性约束；Markowitz 投资组合例子则示范了数学公式与代码的逐行对应。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"优化与数学规划","id":"优化与数学规划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JuMP 建模范式","id":"jump-建模范式"},{"level":2,"text":"MathOptInterface 抽象层","id":"mathoptinterface-抽象层"},{"level":2,"text":"非线性优化与自动微分","id":"非线性优化与自动微分"},{"level":2,"text":"Convex.jl：规范凸优化","id":"convex-jl-规范凸优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Optimization.jl：统一无约束/约束优化","id":"optimization-jl-统一无约束-约束优化"},{"level":2,"text":"整数规划与组合优化","id":"整数规划与组合优化"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：投资组合优化","id":"实战-投资组合优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"微分方程求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/scientific-core/differential-equations"},"next":{"title":"数据处理与 DataFrames","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization/dataframes-processing"}}